<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<c:choose><c:when test="${view eq 'catalog'}"><div class="guide">
<c:if test="${guideTab eq 'products'}"><section class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-products-title"><h1 id="guide-products-title">전체 상품</h1><p>투어패스는 여행 날짜 하루 동안 포함된 관광지·음식점·카페의 혜택을 각 1회 받을 수 있는 이용권이에요.</p>
<p>상품의 혜택 장소를 담아 여행을 시작한 뒤 자유롭게 바꿔 보세요. 상품 선택만으로 저장·구매되지 않아요.</p>
<p><a href="${root}/merchants?tab=facilities">혜택 받는 곳 모아 보기 →</a></p>
<div class="journey-pass-list product-pass-list">
<article class="journey-card pass-card journey-business-card ${not empty directCover.coverImage ? 'has-cover' : ''}"><c:set var="cover" value="${directCover}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover.jspf" %><div class="pass-card-main"><span class="journey-ticket-status">나만의 여행</span><h2><a class="journey-card-link" href="${root}${empty user ? '/explore' : '/journeys/new'}">직접 카드 고르기</a></h2><p class="journey-ticket-date">원하는 장소를 직접 담아 시작해요.</p><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover-credit.jspf" %></div></article>
<c:forEach var="item" items="${data.products}"><article class="pass-card journey-business-card product-pass ${not empty item.coverImage ? 'has-cover' : ''}"><c:set var="cover" value="${item}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover.jspf" %><div class="pass-card-main"><span class="journey-ticket-status">추천 여행 구성</span><h2><a href="${root}/products/detail?id=${item.id}"><c:out value="${item.name}"/></a></h2><details class="product-benefits"><summary>받을 수 있는 혜택 ${fn:length(item.benefits)}개</summary><ul class="guide-benefit-list"><c:forEach var="benefit" items="${item.benefits}"><li><strong><c:out value="${benefit.merchantName}"/></strong> <c:out value="${benefit.name}"/></li></c:forEach></ul><p class="form-hint">투어패스 구매 후 각 1회 이용할 수 있어요.</p></details>
<c:set var="issueProduct" value="${item}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/start-product.jspf" %><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover-credit.jspf" %></div></article></c:forEach>
</div>
<c:if test="${empty data.products}"><p>판매 중인 상품이 없습니다.</p></c:if></section></c:if>
<c:if test="${guideTab eq 'facilities'}"><section class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="guide-facilities-title"><h1 id="guide-facilities-title">이용 가능 시설</h1><p>이용권 혜택은 아래 가맹점에서만 받을 수 있어요. 여행 카드의 관광지·행사·음식점·카페는 안내 자료이며 이용권 혜택이 포함되지 않습니다.</p>
<div class="destination-grid"><c:forEach var="item" items="${data.merchants}"><article class="destination-card guide-facility"><h2><a href="${root}/merchants/detail?id=${item.id}"><c:out value="${item.name}"/></a></h2><p><c:out value="${item.regionName}"/> · <c:out value="${item.locationDescription}"/></p>
<ul class="guide-benefit-list"><c:forEach var="benefit" items="${item.benefits}"><li><strong><c:choose><c:when test="${benefit.benefitType eq 'FREE_ONCE'}">1회 무료</c:when><c:otherwise><c:out value="${benefit.discountWon}"/>원 할인</c:otherwise></c:choose></strong> <c:out value="${benefit.name}"/></li></c:forEach></ul></article></c:forEach></div>
<c:if test="${empty data.merchants}"><p>등록된 가맹점이 없습니다.</p></c:if></section></c:if>
</div>
</c:when><c:when test="${view eq 'product'}">
<article class="pass-card journey-business-card product-pass ${not empty data.coverImage ? 'has-cover' : ''}"><c:set var="cover" value="${data}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover.jspf" %><div class="pass-card-main"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/catalog-heading.jspf" %>
<p>여행 날짜 하루 · 포함 혜택 각 1회</p>
<c:set var="issueProduct" value="${data}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/start-product.jspf" %><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover-credit.jspf" %></div></article>
<p>여행을 구성한 뒤 여행 확인이나 확정한 여행에서 투어패스를 구매할 수 있어요.</p><c:set var="benefits" value="${data.benefits}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/pass/benefits.jspf" %>
</c:when><c:otherwise>
<article class="destination-card destination-detail"><div class="destination-content"><c:if test="${view eq 'place'}"><c:set var="imagePlace" value="${data}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/place-image.jspf" %></c:if>
<%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/catalog-heading.jspf" %><p><c:out value="${data.regionName}"/> · <c:out value="${data.locationDescription}"/></p>
<c:if test="${view eq 'place'}"><p><c:out value="${data.materialKind eq 'REAL' ? '실제 관광 소개' : '시연 자료'}"/> · 검토 상태: <c:out value="${data.reviewStatusLabel}"/></p><p>근거: <c:out value="${data.evidenceNote}"/></p>
<c:if test="${not empty data.sourceUrl}"><p><a href="${fn:escapeXml(data.sourceUrl)}" rel="noopener noreferrer">소개 출처</a> · 확인일 <c:out value="${data.checkedOn}"/></p></c:if>
<c:forEach var="source" items="${data.sources}"><p><a href="${fn:escapeXml(source.sourceUrl)}" rel="noopener noreferrer">추가 출처</a> · <c:out value="${source.checkedOn}"/> · <c:out value="${source.evidenceNote}"/></p></c:forEach>
<c:set var="addPlaceId" value="${data.id}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/add-journey.jspf" %>
<p>영업·예약·이동 가능성: 미확인. 추천과 소개는 이용 가능성을 보장하지 않습니다.</p><c:if test="${data.materialKind eq 'REAL'}"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/visit-info.jspf" %></c:if></c:if>
</div></article><c:set var="benefits" value="${data.benefits}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/pass/benefits.jspf" %>
</c:otherwise></c:choose>

<c:if test="${view eq 'place'}"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/catalog/place-feedback.jspf" %></c:if>
